BINARIES
  Download the binaries for your operating system from 
  https://github.com/MilanSkocic/codata/releases.
  The archives contains 3 folders bin, lib and share that you can simply
  copy/paste somewhere on your PATH:
    - Unix-like: $HOME/.local
    - Windows: add .local to your %USERPROFILE% and add it to your PATH


SOURCES
  Building the static and shared libraries requires the following dependencies:
    - gfortran(1) >=14
    - gcc(1) >=14
    - fpm(1) >=0.12
    - python(1) >=3.10
 
        $ ./configure
        $ make
        $ make install [prefix=path]

  Building the Python wheel requires a python interpreter >=3.10

        $ make python
  
  Install the wheels in the py/sdist/ folder with pip.
